# Node.js Service Rules — {{ .ServiceNamePascal }}

## Architecture (Non-negotiable)

- **4-layer strict**: Routes → Controllers → Services → Repositories
- Routes ONLY define URL mappings
- Services NEVER import Express (no req/res)
- Repositories use Prisma ONLY

## Code Standards

- Pino for ALL logging — no `console.log` in production code
- AppError class for business errors with HTTP status
- Constructor-based DI — no module-level singletons in business code
- Max 300 lines per file

## Build Gates

- `npm test` MUST pass before any commit
- `npm run lint` MUST pass before any commit

## Conventional Commits

`feat:`, `fix:`, `test:`, `refactor:`, `chore:` — no other prefixes

